\]

Let $v_i$ be the profit (Value) per unit of vehicle $i$, and $w_i$ be the weight (Weight) per unit of vehicle $i$. The total inventory capacity is $765$.

The data for each vehicle type is as follows:

\[
\begin{array}{llll}
\text{ProductName} & v_i & w_i \\
\hline
\text{Sedan} & 2524 & 99 \\
\text{SUV} & 4614 & 55 \\
\text{Truck} & 8416 & 75 \\
