The mathematical model is:

\[
\textbf{Objective:} \quad \max \sum_{i=1}^{25} v_i x_i
\]

\[
\textbf{Subject to:} \quad \sum_{i=1}^{25} w_i x_i \leq 765
\]

\[
x_i \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0}, \quad \forall i = 1, \ldots, 25
\]

Where:

- $x_i$ = number of vehicles of type $i$ to order per day (nonnegative integer)
- $v_i$ = profit per unit of vehicle $i$ (see table above)
- $w_i$ = weight per unit of vehicle $i$ (see table above)
- $765$ = total inventory capacity

All data and identifiers are preserved as retrieved.[0m

